  "scope": "The literal1560-slot machine executes original row-label generation and positive minimum selection, branches on the actual optional record, reads its actual retained index pointer, and passes that index and the same original cost row/exponent into the unchanged computed-lambda/shifted-row machine. All-zero and empty rows return the actual absence root. Positive rows return exactly the original raw shifted row for the original minimumPositive occurrence; its validity and index-width bound are derived internally. No vertex list, selected index, minimum, dimension, width, fuel, lambda or shifted row is supplied. The same physical run retains the original inputs/source and pays terminal cost. Its generic bound uses original row bits/list length and exponent length/value; the explicit grid-range corollary removes numerical exponent dependence while retaining the later controller invariant. Original represented input,H/A,dense cursor and exponent remain premises. Complete guess/solver and the outer grid loop remain separate. Twelve physical cases independently specify absence or every unreduced output fraction, including stable equal-rational ties, zero rows, padded exponents and last-row selection.",
